_archive/*

# Rust build artifacts
/target/
Cargo.lock

# editors/vscode/ (Node.js/TypeScript extension) build artifacts
editors/vscode/node_modules/
editors/vscode/out/
editors/vscode/*.vsix
editors/vscode/.vscode-test/
# Copied fresh from the repo-root CHANGELOG.md by the "vscode:prepublish" npm
# script (package.json) every time `vsce package`/`publish` runs, so the
# Marketplace/Open VSX "Changelog" tab (which reads CHANGELOG.md from the
# packaged extension's own root, not the repo's) never goes stale via a
# hand-maintained duplicate -- same drift risk this project already hit once
# with CONTRIBUTING.md's old Configuration section, deliberately not repeated
# here.
editors/vscode/CHANGELOG.md
